<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - New Horizon - 65,000/10 tonnes coal Richards Bay/Jorf Lasfar 26 July/3 Aug $7.95 fio scale load/l2,000 shinc Safmarine.</p>
<p>TBN - 50,000/l0 petroleum coke Pascagoula/Terneuzen July/Aug $9.20 fio 15,000/15,000 shex SSM.</p>
<p>ORE - Hydra - 160,000/10 tonnes ore Saldanha/Beilun mid Aug $7.85 fio scale load/15,000 shex Wa Ga.</p>
</text>
